Upstream Attribution — vphone-cli
=========================================================================

Autophone builds upon the iOS virtualization runtime, host/guest Unix domain
socket (UDS) wire protocol (`upstream_v1`), and tooling ecosystem pioneered by
`vphone-cli` (https://github.com/Lakr233/vphone-cli), originally developed by
Lakr233 and contributors. Early iterations of Autophone were adapted from a
fork of `vphone-cli` before converging on the upstream `vphone-cli` protocol.

